code-to-recovery catalog.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Swift type checker remains responsible for view initializer arguments,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exhaustive switching, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":" payload requirements. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"constrained generic router is supported when its payload meets those route","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requirements:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift compile","code":["import SwiftUI","import InnoRouter","","@Router","enum DetailRoute<Value: Hashable & Sendable> {","    case detail(Value)","","    var destination: some View {","        Text(\"Detail\")","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The macro cannot prove that a view is mounted below a matching host or that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host publishes the action being invoked because SwiftUI’s environment","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hierarchy is built at runtime. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentRouter"},{"text":" therefore diagnoses a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"missing host, mismatched route type, or unavailable capability at action time.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Manual escape hatch","anchor":"Manual-escape-hatch","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Advanced targets can keep the compiler-plugin target out of their build graph","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by depending on the granular ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"InnoRouterSwiftUI"},{"text":" product and writing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"conformance directly:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift compile","code":["import Swif